com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-28T16:56:01Z","updated_at":"2024-03-28T16:56:01Z","body":"I think this is related to a conversation that has come up repeatedly on the mailing list, including recently! See https://lists.spdx.org/g/Spdx-legal/topic/105158733#3538\r\n\r\n@Pandapip1 - is the text you have in the PR something that is actually used (verbatim) by the US Gov't?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2025686916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2025912955","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2419#issuecomment-2025912955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2419","id":2025912955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE854wPp7","user":{"login":"Pandapip1","id":45835846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODM1ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45835846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1","html_url":"https://github.com/Pandapip1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandapip1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-28T19:03:08Z","updated_at":"2024-03-28T19:03:35Z","body":"Yes the text itself is verbatim. I only adjusted the formatting: https://github.com/ncbi/sra-tools/blob/master/LICENSE","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2025912955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2101797374","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2419#issuecomment-2101797374","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2419","id":2101797374,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE859RuH-","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-09T02:04:06Z","updated_at":"2024-05-09T02:04:06Z","body":"+1 to add this to the license list. Despite being a public domain notice, it has a defined text and appears to be widely used by NCBI projects (see [GitHub search](https://github.com/search?q=%22PUBLIC+DOMAIN+NOTICE%22+%22National+Center+for+Biotechnology+Information%22&type=code)). And we've added specific public domain notices previously for widely-used, fixed texts (e.g., [SQLite's `blessing`](https://spdx.org/licenses/blessing.html).\r\n\r\nTaking a look at some of those search results, I see a few variations to the text for some projects:\r\n\r\n1. Some omit the \"With the exception of certain third-party files summarized below\" at the start\r\n2. Some use \"software/database\" instead of \"software\" in the 1st and 3rd sentences\r\n3. Some use \"the authors'\" (single quote after s) where others use \"the author's\" (single quote before s)\r\n4. Some say \"duties as a United States Government employee\" where others say \"duties as United States Government employees\"\r\n5. Some say \"author\" instead of \"authors\" in the final sentence\r\n\r\nI'm comfortable with all of these being handled via `<optional>` or `<alt>` text markup in the XML file. I don't think any of these are substantive differences, and I think they can all be appropriately grouped together into a single ID.\r\n\r\n@Pandapip1's suggestion of `NCBI-PD` for ID and \"NCBI Public Domain Notice\" as name seems appropriate to me.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2101797374/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2103004672","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2419#issuecomment-2103004672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2419","id":2103004672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE859WU4A","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-09T16:29:53Z","updated_at":"2024-05-09T16:29:53Z","body":"agree with @swinslow's assessment above and +1 to add","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2103004672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2103007930","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2419#issuecomment-2103007930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2419","id":2103007930,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE859WVq6","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-09T16:32:11Z","updated_at":"2024-05-09T16:32:11Z","body":"# License Inclusion Decision\r\n\r\n## Decision:\r\n\r\n- [X] approved\r\n- [ ] not approved\r\n\r\n## Name\r\n\r\nNCBI Public Domain Notice\r\n\r\n## License ID\r\n\r\n`NCBI-PD`\r\n\r\n## XML markup\r\n\r\nAs noted above\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nMention US government work / public domain\r\n\r\n## Next steps ##\r\n\r\n@swinslow to prepare revised PR based off of #2433","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2103007930/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2103055395","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2419#issuecomment-2103055395","issu